# Review Benny on your phone

Open **Review_on_Android.pdf**. The first three pages show your original art, Claudia’s real game and the new character at the same opening camera. The following three pages zoom into the fur and hat. Each picture has its own page.

Open **CODEX_NEW/ride.mp4** to watch the proposed character swim, or **CLAUDIA_BEFORE/ride.mp4** to watch the identical run with Claudia’s Benny. The native originals, turns and end views are separate files. This character experiment runs on Claudia’s Screen 06 scenery. The separate curved-washer review has its own proof. [Results](REPORT.md) · [Full-size pictures and videos](PHONE_REVIEW.md)

## One download for both Screen 06 experiments

The ZIP also includes **SCENERY_CODEX_NEW**, the verified bent-washer candidate at **94c36531af3cce486a252e56f75b81595536ad96**. Its **ride.mp4** keeps Claudia’s original Benny. The main **CODEX_NEW/ride.mp4** keeps Claudia’s original scenery and changes Benny. Both are compared with **CLAUDIA_BEFORE/ride.mp4**. The final PDF pages show the separate scenery test. The package contains photographs and captures from both branches. Each experiment remains isolated and unmerged. [Verified scenery branch](https://github.com/josiahscalia5-dev/rainbow-/blob/94c36531af3cce486a252e56f75b81595536ad96/experiments/codex/s06-arched-washer-passage/PHONE_REVIEW.md)
